<title>UK: TABLE - Imperial Tobacco H1 pretax 143 mln stg.</title>
<headline>TABLE - Imperial Tobacco H1 pretax 143 mln stg.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to March 29</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		18.6		   vs N/A</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	 7.2		    vs N/A</p>
<p> Pretax		     143		    vs 174</p>
<p> Turnover		   1,944		  vs 1,861</p>
<p>NOTE - Current year pretax profit included a 40 million stg charge for net interest expense.</p>
<p>Analysts had forecast pre-tax profits in a range between 136.0 and 150.0 million stg.</p>
<p>The company said operating profit was 183 million stg versus 174 million stg.</p>
<p>Full company name - Imperial Tobacco Group Plc. -London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
